Package: klipa-player
Version: @VERSION@
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: Klipa Project <security@klipa.invalid>
Depends: libgtk-3-0 | libgtk-3-0t64, libmpv2, libsecret-1-0
Description: Lightweight local-first IPTV player
 Bring your own M3U, M3U8, or Xtream-compatible provider. Klipa Player
 includes no channels, accounts, telemetry, background service, or guide proxy.
